<p class="bodyText">Citation for the whole project: Jepson Flora Project (eds.) <span id="year"></span>. Jepson eFlora, https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/ [accessed on <span id="day"></span> <span id="month"></span>]</p> 
